                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \{1/n\}_{n \in \mathbb{N}} \to \{0\}\cup \{1/n\}_{n \in \mathbb{N}} \,\,&amp;solb;\,\, A\to X.
          %h4#in_topological_spaces In topological spaces
          %p
            The following lifting properties are calculated in the category of (all) topological spaces. Below we use notation defined in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/separation+axioms+in+terms+of+lifting+properties#NotationForFiniteTopologicalSpaces"} the page on lifting properties
          %h4#iterated_lifting_properties Iterated lifting properties
          %ul
            %li
              %p
