                      %mo ⟶
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} {
                      %mi o
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} }
                      %msup
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %mrow
                          %mi ⧄
                          %mi r
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (\emptyset\longrightarrow \{o\})^{&amp;solb;r}
                is the class of surjections
            %li
